<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered a round of fixed rate operations at a repo rate of 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to March 18 and 19 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before March 19, it said.  </p>
<p>The Bank also said it had revised its forecast of the money market shortage to 950 million stg from 850 million previously.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
